          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "HTTP call inside `BEGIN` — locks held for the timeout",
            "Message publish, then broker is slow — snapshot pins",
            "User prompt mid-transaction — think-time is minutes",
            "Long analytics `SELECT` in a write txn — blocks VACUUM"
          ],
          "style": "cross"
        },
        {
